Government open data portals (data.gov, police.uk)
Police department FIR databases (via API or export)
Manual uploads from partner agencies
Scheduled batch imports (daily, weekly)

Error Handling:

Quarantine invalid records for manual review
Email notifications to administrators on ingestion failures
Retry logic for API failures (3 attempts with exponential backoff)


