FR-MA-003: Real-Time Safety Alerts
Priority: P0 (Critical)
User Story: As a user, I want to receive immediate warnings when I enter dangerous areas so I can change my route.
Description: App shall send push notifications when user enters or approaches high-risk zones based on configurable thresholds.
Acceptance Criteria:
Alert Triggering:

Geofencing: Monitor user location every 30 seconds (configurable)
Trigger conditions:

User within 200 meters of high-risk zone boundary
Risk score exceeds user's alert threshold (default: 60)
First entry only (no repeated alerts for same zone within 1 hour)


Alert types:

Low risk (30-60): In-app notification only
Moderate risk (61-80): Push notification + in-app
High risk (81-90): Push + vibration + in-app
Critical risk (91-100): Push + vibration + sound (overrides silent mode)



Push Notification Content:
Notification Title: "⚠️ High Risk Area Ahead"
Notification Body: "You're entering a high theft area. 
Stay alert and secure valuables."
Actions: [View Details] [Get Safe Route] [Dismiss]
