FR-MA-005: Women Safety Mode
Priority: P1 (High)
User Story: As a woman traveling alone, I want enhanced safety features that account for my specific vulnerabilities.
Description: Specialized mode providing enhanced safety features specifically addressing women's safety concerns during vulnerable situations.
Acceptance Criteria:
Activation:

Manual: Toggle in app settings OR quick-access widget
Automatic: Auto-activate during configured hours (default: 10 PM - 6 AM)
Visual indicator: Purple theme / icon when active
Persistent notification: "Women Safety Mode Active"

Enhanced Features:
1. Lower Alert Thresholds:

Trigger alerts at risk score ≥ 50 (vs. standard 60)
More sensitive to isolation and nighttime risks
Prioritize warnings over reducing alert fatigue

2. Isolation Detection:

Algorithm analyzes crowd density estimates
Trigger: User alone (crowd <10 people per 100m radius) in moderate+ risk zone
Alert message: "You're alone in a moderate risk area. Stay on main roads."
Data sources:

Foot traffic models (from historical patterns)
Business operating hours (open establishments = safer)
Transit schedules (last bus/train timing)



Isolation Detection Logic:
pythonif women_safety_mode_enabled:
    if time.hour >= 22 or time.hour <= 6:  # Night hours
        crowd_density = estimate_crowd_density(location, time)
        if crowd_density < 10:  # People per 100m radius
            if location_risk_score > 50:
                trigger_isolation_alert()
3. Quick SOS Button:

Prominent red SOS button always visible on main screen
Activation: Press and hold for 3 seconds (prevents accidental triggers)
Actions triggered:

SMS to emergency contacts with live location link
In-app alert to nearby users (opt-in SafetyNet network)
Audio recording starts (if user pre-consented)
Flash SOS signal on screen
Optional: Auto-call emergency services (Phase 2)



SOS Message Format:
🚨 EMERGENCY ALERT 🚨

[Name] has activated their safety alert.

Current Location:
https://maps.google.com/?q=40.7128,-74.0060

Time: Jan 26, 2026 10:45 PM

This is an automated message from Crime Safety App.
4. Fake Call Feature:

Simulates incoming phone call for deterrence
Configurable caller ID (e.g., "Mom", "Dad", "Friend")
Realistic ringtone and vibration
Option to have fake conversation (pre-recorded audio)
Trigger: One-tap button OR shake gesture

5. Night-Time Route Preferences:

Prioritize well-lit main roads over shortcuts
Avoid parks, alleys, isolated areas
Prefer routes near open businesses
Show street lighting status on map (if data available)

6. Check-In Feature:

Set expected arrival time
Auto-notify contacts if not checked in by deadline
"I'm Safe" one-tap check-in button
Automatic check-in when reaching destination

7. Share Live Location:

Share real-time location with trusted contacts
Time-limited: 15 min / 30 min / 1 hour / Until I arrive
Shareable link: https://safety.app/live/[unique-token]
Recipients don't need app installed

