User can edit/delete own reports within 24 hours

Notification to User:

Push notification when status changes
Email notification for verified/resolved reports

Authority Notification:

High severity reports → Immediate email to authorities
Moderate severity → Daily digest
Low severity → Weekly digest

Community Alerts:

If user opts-in "Notify nearby users":

